## IV Proposed Hierarchical LLM Framework

To bridge the latency gap between semantic reasoning and real-time aerodynamic control, we propose a Cloud-Edge Agentic architecture, as illustrated in Fig. [2](https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2607.18604v1#S4.F2 "Figure 2 ‣ IV Proposed Hierarchical LLM Framework ‣ Intelligent Multi-UAV Navigation in ITNTNs: A Hierarchical LLM Approach"). The framework separates decision-making into three distinct timescales: 1) slow strategic meta-timescale (THAPST\_{\mathrm{HAPS}}), 2) intermediate tactical reasoning timescale (TLLMT\_{\mathrm{LLM}}), and 3) fast physical execution timescale (TfastT\_{\mathrm{fast}}).

